[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0010","text":"衣服，是2件一样的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0020","text":"鞋子，是2双一样的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0030","text":"我们两个，一模一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0040","text":"两个人，是同一个人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0050","text":"（纸巾……水……米……\n　还有……晚饭的食材……各种……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0060","text":"……好、好重……好多……东西……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0070","text":"（但是……是小奈的轮班……\n　甜花说了要替她的……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0080","text":"……必须做……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0090","text":"……呼…………\n…………呼…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0100","text":"……甜花……！？\n没事吧……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0110","text":"小、小奈……！\n你该躺着……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0120","text":"烧已经差不多退了，没事的\n比起那个，很重吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0122","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0130","text":"让你替我做，对不起……！\n收拾的事也让甘奈帮忙吧！\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0140","text":"……但、但是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0150","text":"甘奈辛苦的时候，甜花\n超级努力帮了我对吧？　所以，对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0160","text":"嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0162","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0170","text":"这样就全部……搞定了！\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0180","text":"嘿嘿……清爽了……！\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0190","text":"（果然……小奈……\n　好快……）\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_00_0200","text":"（但是，甜花……也许还能……\n　再努力一点的……）\n "}]
